25t. Psalms; 45t. Proverbs): (1) Isa 29:13 ; Lev 5:4 (P), Job 13:6 ; Mal 2:6 ; Psa 12:5 ; Prov 5:3 +; שׂ ׳דַּל Psa 141:3 (see דָּל ); שׂ ׳אִישׁ Job 11:2 = a talker, שׂ ׳אֱוִיל Prov 10:8 +? 10:10 ( ᵑ0 ; but see Toy); שְׂפָתַיִם טְמֵא Isa 6:5 (twice in verse) compare 6:7 ; Dan 10:16 ; שׂ ׳עֲרַל Exod 6:12 , 30 (P; unskilled in speech); שׂ ׳עִקֵּשׁ 19:1 ; שׂ ׳מֹּתֶה 20:19 see [ מָּתָה ] p. 834; שׂ ׳מוֺצָא i.e. utterance, Deut 23:24 ; Jer 17:16 ; Num 30:13 (P), Psa 89:35 , שׂ ׳רוּחַ Isa 11:4 (of Messianic king), שׂ ׳דְּבַר Psa 59:13 ; Prov 14:23 +, = mere, empty, word 2Kin 18:20 = Isa 36:5 ; שׂ ׳תְּבוּאַת Prov 18:20 , שׂ ׳נוב Isa 57:19 (thanksgiving), compare Hosea 14:3 ( ᵑ6 ᵐ5 and most מְּדִי for מָּרִים ); of flattery, שׂ ׳חֵלֶק Prov 7:21 , חֲלָקוֺת שְׂפַת Psa 12:3 ; 12:4 ; compare מִרְמָה שִׂפְתֵי 17:1 , ׳שׂ שֶׁקֶר 31:9 4 t., אָוֶן שְׂפַת Prov 17:4 ; poison beneath (compare לָשׁוֺן ) Psa 140:4 (figurative); שׂ ׳מֶּשַׁע Prov 12:13 ; שׂ ׳לְזוּת 4:24 ; ׳שׂ אֱמֶת 12:19 , ׳שׂ יָ֑תֶר 17:7 , ׳שׂ צֶדֶק 16:13 , ׳שׂ דַּעַת 14:7 ; 20:15 ; שׂ ׳חֵן 22:11 ; בְרוּרָה שָׂפָה Zeph 3:9 ; ׳שׂ רְנָנוֺת Psa 63:5 i.e. lips that shout for joy; with verbs: שׂ ׳מָּתַח (to speak) Job 11:5 ; 30:20 (Gi 30:21 ), compare Psa 51:17 , שׂ ׳מִפְתַּח Prov 8:6 ; שׂ ׳מָּשַׁק 13:3 i.e. prate; ׳שׂ זַעַם מָֽלְאוּ Isa 30:27 ; ׳שׂ subject of דִּבֶּר 59:3 ; Prov 24:2 ; עַלשֿׂ ׳נָשָׂא Psalm 16:14; שׂ ׳קָרַץ 16:30 = backbite; שׂ ׳אָטַם 17:28 +? שׂ ׳חָשַׂךְ 10:19 , ׳שׂ כָּלָא Psa 40:10 . (2) lips moving in speech, with נוּעַ 1Sam 1:13 , נִיד Job 16:5 . (3) transition to meaning speech , לָשׁוֺן עַלשְֿׂפַת עָלָה Ezek 36:3 ; = ability to speak Job 12:20 . b. organ of laughter Job 8:21 . c. of insulting grimace בְּשׂ ׳הִפְטִיר Psa 22:8 . d. quivering in terror Hab 3:16 . e. feature of beauty Song 4:3 (scarlet). f. place of bridle 2Kin 19:28 = Isa 37:29 (see מֶתֶג ). g. receiving kiss Prov 24:26 compare Song 4:11 and (in figurative) 7:10 . h. of divine speech , שׂ ׳מִצְוַת Job 23:12 , שׂ ׳דְּבַר Psa 17:4 . 2 language (see לָשׁוֺן ), Gen 11:1 , 6 , 7 (twice in verse); 11:9 ; Psa 81:6 ; שׂ עִמְקֵי ׳עַם Ezek 3:5-6 , Isa 33:19 , שׂ ׳לַעֲגֵי 28:11 ; כְּנַעַן שְׂפַת 19:18 (i.e. Hebrew). 3 edge: shore of sea Gen 22:17 (J) + 7 t.; bank of river 41:3 , 17 (E) + 5 t., of wady ( נַחַל ) Deut 2:36 7 t.; lip (bank) of מְחוֺלָה אָבֵל Judg 7:22 compare GASm G 400 ; brim of vessel 1Kin 7:23 (twice in verse) + 7 t.; edge of altar Ezek 43:13 ; of curtains (in pairs) Exod 26:4 (twice in verse) (P) + 6 t.; of חשֶׁן , toward ephod 28:26 = 39:19 (P); of round opening in robe ׳שׂ לְפִיו (יִהְיֶה) 28:32 = 39:23 (P).","rootNote":"or (in dual and plural) שֶׂפֶת ; probably from 5595 or 8192 through the idea of termination (compare 5490 );","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 5 9","keyReferences":["1Kgs 5 9","1Kgs 7 23","1Kgs 7 24","1Kgs 7 26","1Kgs 7 26","1Kgs 9 26","1Sam 1 13","1Sam 13 5"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":177,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 5 9","book":"1Kgs","chapter":5,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׂפַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 23","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/שְּׂפָת֨/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 24","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לִ/שְׂפָת֤/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 26","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וּ/שְׂפָת֛/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 7 26","book":"1Kgs","chapter":7,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׂפַת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Kgs 9 26","book":"1Kgs","chapter":9,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׂפַ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 1 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":1,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"שְׂפָתֶ֣י/הָ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfdc/Sp3fs"},{"r